ssica Chastain patches face up then  proceeded down into the sewers to finish  Pennywise but the emotional tension is  interrupted when Eddy's bandage briefly  flips from one side of his face to the  other this can happen when the negative  gets reversed but it should have been an  easy thing to catch and fix for the  adult losers to vanquish penny wise Mike  played by Isaiah Mustafa determines that  they need to perform the ritual of  shutdown and Pennywise is feeding layer  but in order to fully complete the  ritual each loser must bring a token  that was significant to them during the  summer when they faced the monster as  children in 1989 Eddy's token is his  asthma inhaler Ritchie's as a video game  token Bin's is the page of his yearbook  that only Beverly signed Bev's is the  postcard poem that Ben wrote her and  bills is the paper boat that he made for  his little brother but somehow even  after the losers get fully immersed in  the murky sewer water the paper tokens  belonging to Bev Ben and Bill are still  completely dry when they toss them into  the fire the paper boat may still have  been safe due to the wax coating bill  applied on it for Georgie at the  beginning of the first film but the  postcard in the yearbook page should  have been sopping wet check out one of  our newest videos right here plus even  more Lube or videos about your favorite  movies are coming soon subscribe to our  YouTube channel and hit the bell so you  don't miss a single one  [Music]  you  [Music]

